stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> DRAFTED

    DRAFTED --> PRE_REGISTERED: owner files question, method, pass threshold, amber band and kill criterion
    DRAFTED --> WITHDRAWN: the decision it fed no longer exists

    PRE_REGISTERED --> IN_COLLECTION: first datum captured or first interview held
    PRE_REGISTERED --> PRE_REGISTERED: threshold amended BEFORE collection, with reason logged

    IN_COLLECTION --> REPORTED: artefact produced and filed in the dossier
    IN_COLLECTION --> BLOCKED: dependency unavailable such as design partner, counsel or portal access
    BLOCKED --> IN_COLLECTION: dependency resolved
    BLOCKED --> ESCALATED: blocked past the gate date it feeds

    REPORTED --> CLOSED_PASS: result clears the pre-registered pass threshold
    REPORTED --> CLOSED_AMBER: result lands in the amber band
    REPORTED --> CLOSED_FAIL: result meets the kill criterion
    CLOSED_AMBER --> IN_COLLECTION: sample widened under the SAME threshold

    CLOSED_PASS --> REOPENED: a later capture contradicts the result
    CLOSED_FAIL --> REOPENED: the underlying source is re-read and found different
    CLOSED_PASS --> SUPERSEDED: the instrument or page it rested on is replaced
    REOPENED --> IN_COLLECTION: re-run under a NEW pre-registration record

    CLOSED_FAIL --> THESIS_REVIEW: the item is named in a whole-thesis kill condition
    ESCALATED --> THESIS_REVIEW: the gate it feeds cannot clear in time

    note right of PRE_REGISTERED
        A threshold changed after collection starts
        is a rationalisation, not a threshold.
        The record is append only.
    end note

    note right of CLOSED_FAIL
        Fail is a result, not a failure.
        The pre-agreed response fires
        without further argument.
    end note
